Welcome to MirrorOS Live/Rescue.

The guided installer starts on tty1. Cancel to return to the shell;
run mirroros-install to restart it. Startup does not authorize disk writes.

For Wi-Fi, authenticate using iwctl; iw and wpa_supplicant remain available
for manual diagnosis and fallback. Ethernet uses DHCP automatically.

Rescue tools include Vim, disk inspection, FAT/ext4/Btrfs utilities,
and arch-chroot. Keep independent rescue media before installing.

Upstream Arch Linux installation documentation:
https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Installation_guide
